Corrected copy of Adam Wlostowski's 2020 MC kernel (awlostowski-noaa/t-route@27e06ee,
src/fortran_routing/mc_pylink_v00/MC_singleSeg_singleTS/courant_dev/
MCsingleSegStime_f2py_NOLOOP-anw.f90), used only by repro/mc_courant_timestep's
"corrected" variant (run_corrected.py). The faithful reproduction compiles the file
unmodified. The same corrections as the T-Route series (repro/kernel_fixes/patches/
0001-0008), adapted to this older file; each hunk is labelled FIX 000k with the series
number. FIX 0005 here also sets velc on the no-flow branch, which this version leaves
unassigned. Apply in a directory holding the file: git apply -p1 anw2020-corrected.patch
AI-drafted (Claude), 2026-10-09; not yet reviewed by the author.

